@OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5097
@ApiKey = OpsConnect-LocalDev-ApiKey

### Health Check
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### List Configured Branches (Organisation Read)
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/branches?isActive=true
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

### Retrieve Organisation Hierarchy Tree
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/hierarchy?includeInactive=false
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

### Submit RFFO Activity Update
POST {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/submissions
Content-Type: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.admin
X-OpsConnect-Role: Admin

{
  "activityCode": "RFFO",
  "rawMessageText": "Activity : RFFO\nBranch Code : 36:01\nStatus : Pending",
  "telegramMessageLogId": 10001,
  "telegramUserId": 9001,
  "senderUsername": "branch3601_user",
  "senderDisplayName": "Branch 36:01 Operator"
}

### Retrieve Daily RFFO Status & Population Summary
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/RFFO/status
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

### Retrieve Branch Current Status
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/RFFO/branches/36:01/status
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

### Retrieve Branch Status History
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/RFFO/branches/36:01/history
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

### Grant Reopen Permission (Admin Only)
POST {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/reopen-permissions
Content-Type: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.admin
X-OpsConnect-Role: Admin

{
  "activityCode": "RFFO",
  "branchCode": "36:01",
  "reason": "Branch reported accidental premature completion"
}

### List Reopen Permissions
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/reopen-permissions?activityCode=RFFO
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

### List Activities
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities?includeInactive=true
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

### Retrieve Activity Details & Settings
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/RFFO
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

### Retrieve Effective Reporting Schedule & History
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/RFFO/reporting-schedule
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

### Preview Calculated Daily Reporting Slots
POST {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/activities/reporting-slots/preview
Content-Type: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer

{
  "reportingStartTime": "09:00:00",
  "reportingEndTime": "18:00:00",
  "reportingIntervalMinutes": 30,
  "timeZoneId": "Asia/Kolkata"
}

### Retrieve Configuration Audit History
GET {{OpsConnect_Api_HostAddress}}/api/configuration-history
Accept: application/json
X-OpsConnect-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-OpsConnect-User: ops.viewer
X-OpsConnect-Role: Viewer
